# ===========================================================================
# THE ARENA VR — website
# ===========================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing in this site reads .env today (it is static, with no build step).
# These are here for the day you add the Paystack webhook or any other
# server-side piece — that is when real secrets start existing.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*secret*
*service-role*
*service_role*

# NOTE — do NOT ignore assets/js/arena.config.js.
# It holds the Paystack PUBLIC key and the Supabase ANON key, both of which are
# designed to be published and are required for the site to work. The keys that
# must never be committed are the Paystack `sk_...` secret key and the Supabase
# `service_role` key — neither belongs in this folder at all.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Notes and scratch work
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
notes
notes/
NOTES/
notes.*
*-notes.*
*.notes
TODO
TODO.*
todo.*
scratch/
scratch.*
draft/
drafts/
*.draft
*.bak
*.orig
*.tmp
*~

# Local backups of the admin accounts export (contains password hashes)
arena-admin-accounts*.json

# CSV exports pulled out of the dashboards
arena-bookings*.csv
arena-customers*.csv
arena-expenses*.csv

